WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.208
Step 1: In Planner, choose Hourly recurrence for a separate checklist occurrence each hour within the window.

2
00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:12.708
Step 2: Choose Location trading hours to base the window on saved opening/closing times, adding offsets when needed.

3
00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:18.708
Step 3: Check the assigned locations have valid hours and review the window’s finish.

4
00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:24.708
Step 4: Activate the planner. Active work appears only when its planned window is open.
